    "eq_deletes": "PyIceberg 0.11.1 has no equality-delete writer and, on read, ignores equality deletes entirely (pyarrow._task_to_record_batches applies only positional deletes). Its row output is therefore recorded as UNFILTERED, and DuckDB is the oracle for the equality-delete gate.",
